        "original_id": "ade70d02-cffe-5c05-9b06-4ea80c38853a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bank Street, Central, Hong Kong, Des Voeux Road Central, Queen's Road Central\n- Organizations: The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation, Bank of China (Hong Kong), HSBC Holdings\n- Buildings: HSBC Main Building, Bank of China Building\n\nFacts:\n- Bank Street is a short street in Central, Hong Kong.\n- Bank Street links Des Voeux Road Central to Queen's Road Central.\n- Bank Street is named for its location between HSBC Main Building and Bank of China Building, which were the former headquarters of The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation and Bank of China (Hong Kong) respectively.\n- HSBC Main Building is the headquarters building of The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation.\n- The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation is now a wholly owned subsidiary of London-based HSBC Holdings.",
